Let something on the internet reach one device here

Usage:
  olr firewall [command]

Available Commands:
  add         Forward a port in from outside
  disable     Remove the port forwards, keeping them configured
  enable      Apply the port forwards
  rm          Stop forwarding a port
  set         Change a port forward
  show        Show what is forwarded in from outside
  status      Show whether anything has arrived through each forward

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for firewall

Global Flags:
      --dry-run         show what would change and exit without applying it
  -o, --output string   output format: text|json (default "text")
      --socket string   olrd control socket (default "/run/olr/olrd.sock")

Use "olr firewall [command] --help" for more information about a command.
